  m_Name: 04-TypesOfForces2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lessonId: forceTypeNonContact
  lessonTitle: Types of Forces Pt. 2
  lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
  lessonDesc: "Non-Contact Forces\nThese are forces that can act on objects without
    them being in direct physical contact.\n      Gravity - the force that attracts
    objects with mass towards each other.\n      Gravitational Force - When an object
    is resting on a surface, it is exerting a downward force equal to its weight.\n     
    Electrostatic Force - It is similar to Gravitational Force, but the difference
    is that the Electrostatic Force acts between two charged objects."
